the Philippines’ leading third-party logistics provider, to WLC Holdings Inc., a wholly-owned vehicle of the founding Chiongbian Family.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:40c7531278c136b1861de3899444dabb","date":"2026-06-25","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Chess.com","portco_name":"Chess.com","target_website":"chess.com","investor":"CVC Capital Partners IX","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["General Atlantic"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC Capital Partners invests in Chess","summary":"CVC Fund IX agreed to invest in Chess.com, joining existing investor General Atlantic.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2026/cvc-capital-partners-invests-in-chess/","evidence":"CVC, one of the world's leading private markets investment firms, with deep expertise investing in sports, video games and other community platforms, today announced that CVC Capital Partners IX (“Fund IX”) has agreed to invest in Chess.com, the world's largest online chess platform.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:0105d2f966c432c38979fcbe0745cc4c","date":"2026-06-26","date_text":null,"kind":"company_exit","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Republic Finance","portco_name":"Republic Finance","target_website":"republicfinance.com","investor":"J.C. Flowers & Co.","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"seller","co_investors":["Nowlake Technology"],"seller":"CVC Capital Partners","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Republic Finance agrees to be acquired by a J.C. Flowers-led investor group","summary":"Republic Finance agreed to be acquired by a J.C. Flowers-led group with Nowlake, as CVC-advised funds exit.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"