mount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"The Reggiani Family chooses CVC to accelerate Clevertech’s global expansion","summary":"CVC agreed with the Reggiani family to acquire 100% of Italian packaging automation group Clevertech from REFA S.r.l.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2026/the-reggiani-family-chooses-cvc-to-accelerate-clevertech-s-global-expansion/","evidence":"The transaction will see CVC acquire 100% of the share capital of Clevertech S.p.A. from REFA S.r.l. (\"REFA\"), the Reggiani Family holding, while REFA will reinvest alongside CVC as a minority shareholder, ensuring full continuity in the management of the business and execution of the Group’s strategy.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:ff2d1f5a6c9c7ae012ecc3c26838da66","date":"2026-06-29","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Irca","portco_name":"Irca","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC Capital Partners IX","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"Advent","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC Capital Partners agrees to acquire Irca from Advent","summary":"CVC Fund IX agreed to acquire Italian ingredients manufacturer Irca from Advent.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2026/cvc-capital-partners-agrees-to-acquire-irca-from-advent/","evidence":"CVC Capital Partners (“CVC”) and Advent today announced that CVC Capital Partners IX (“Fund IX”), has entered into an agreement to acquire Irca, a global B2B manufacturer of ingredient solutions for the food manufacturing, foodservice and artisanal channels, from Advent.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:f79fa105929613d51c91b8f0064306b6","date":"2026-07-02","date_text":null,"kind":"company_exit","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Klara Renewables","portco_name":"Klara Renewables","target_website":null,"investor":"Actis","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":null,"co_investors":[],"seller":"DIF Infrastructure VI","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC DIF agrees sale of Klara Renewables to Actis","summary":"CVC DIF's DIF VI fund agreed to sell Polish onshore wind portfolio Klara Renewables (171 MW) to Actis.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2026/cvc-dif-agrees-sale-of-klara-renewables-to-actis/","evidence":"CVC DIF, the infrastructure strategy of leading global private markets manager CVC, is pleased to announce that DIF Infrastructure VI (“DIF VI”) has signed an agreement to divest Klara Renewables, a portfolio of six operational onshore wind farms in Poland, to Actis, a leading global investor in sustainable infrastructure.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:d8892369c3e73e518b9c1e73f33fd66c","date":"2026-07-06","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"DistroKid","portco_name":"DistroKid","target_website":"distrokid.com","investor":"CVC Capital Partners IX","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["Insight Partners"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC Capital Partners to make majority investment in DistroKid","summary":"CVC Fund IX signed a definitive agreement to make a majority investment in music distributor DistroKid, with Insight Partners retaining a significant minority stake.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2026/cvc-capital-partners-to-make-majority-investment-in-distrokid/","evidence":"DistroKid, the world's leading music distributor, today announced that CVC Capital Partners, one of the world's leading private markets investment firms, has signed a definitive agreement to make a majority investment in the company via CVC Capital Partners IX.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:df359fb39974f9dec4290b7ff3945e45","date":"2026-07-06","date_text":null,"kind":"company_exit","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"D-Marin","portco_name":"D-Marin","target_website":"d-marin.com","investor":"InfraVia Capital Partners","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"seller","co_investors":[],"seller":"CVC Capital Partners VII","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC agrees sale of D-Marin, the leading premium marina operator in the EMEA region to InfraVia Capital Partners","summary":"CVC agreed to sell Fund VII's stake in premium marina operator D-Marin to InfraVia Capital Partners.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2026/cvc-agrees-sale-of-d-marin-the-leading-premium-marina-operator-in-the-emea-region-to-infravia-capital-partners/","evidence":"CVC is pleased to announce that it has entered into an agreement to sell CVC Capital Partners VII’s stake in international premium marina operator, D-Marin, to InfraVia Capital Partners, a leading independent private equity firm in Europe.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:cf1c2bd74383d6f59a09bdc4b2547451","date":"2026-07-17","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"EcoEridania","portco_name":"EcoEridania","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC DIF","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"iCON Infrastructure","round":null,"stake_pct":75.0,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC DIF to acquire a majority stake in EcoEridania","summary":"CVC DIF agreed to acquire a majority stake in Italian waste management operator EcoEridania, with iCON Infrastructure disposing o