rs/","evidence":"CVC DIF, the infrastructure business of leading global private markets manager CVC, has agreed to acquire a significant majority stake in firstcolo Holding GmbH (“firstcolo”), a leading Frankfurt-based colocation data centre operator, from Cube Infrastructure Managers.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:39c8f22cb9c96776ba5b18de393e7c35","date":"2026-08-18","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Silicon2","portco_name":"Silicon2","target_website":"siliconii.com","investor":"CVC Asia VI","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":9.0,"amount":2100000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"enterprise_value","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC Asia invests in leading global distributor of K-beauty products Silicon2","summary":"CVC Asia VI agreed to acquire about 9% of K-beauty distributor Silicon2 through a primary issue of redeemable convertible shares, valuing it at about $2.1bn EV.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2026/cvc-asia-invests-in-leading-global-distributor-of-k-beauty-products-silicon2/","evidence":"The transaction values Silicon2 at an enterprise value of approximately US$2.1 billion and will support the company’s continued global expansion, supply chain optimisation, and professionalisation.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:3da2db9400f714e5a97048e37fc0cb46","date":"2026-08-20","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"OpenRent","portco_name":"OpenRent","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"OpenRent partners with CVC to accelerate growth and innovation in the UK rental market","summary":"Funds managed by CVC agreed to make a majority investment in UK rental platform OpenRent, with its founders remaining significant shareholders.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2026/openrent-partners-with-cvc-to-accelerate-growth-and-innovation-in-the-uk-rental-market/","evidence":"Funds under the management of CVC are making a majority investment in OpenRent, with founders Adam Hyslop and Darius Bradbury remaining significant shareholders and continuing to lead the company.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:90e77aa3b9f8eb2e48e385aebba0a0ae","date":"2026-07-30","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"PT Mitra Adiperkasa Tbk","portco_name":"PT Mitra Adiperkasa Tbk","target_website":"map.co.id","investor":"CVC Asia VI","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC Asia VI agrees to invest in PT Mitra Adiperkasa Tbk","summary":"CVC Asia VI agreed to invest in Indonesian lifestyle retailer MAPI, CVC's tenth investment in Indonesia.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2026/cvc-asia-vi-agrees-to-invest-in-pt-mitra-adiperkasa-tbk/","evidence":"CVC Capital Partners today announced that CVC Asia VI has agreed to invest in PT Mitra Adiperkasa Tbk (\"MAPI\").","verified":null},{"key":"pr:a96b1eabaf50aa9542fd85b03c43b3ba","date":"2026-08-27","date_text":null,"kind":"add_on_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"American Tower Corporation's Canadian tower portfolio","portco_name":null,"target_website":null,"investor":"Aurora Towers","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"co_investor","co_investors":["CVC DIF"],"seller":"American Tower Corporation","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":nu