-with-cvc-for-its-next-chapter/","evidence":"CVC acquires its stake from Horizon Capital, Ridge's partner since April 2023.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:f219c87d473ef0c7371208949deb320c","date":"2026-09-17","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"BauWatch","portco_name":"BauWatch","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC DIF","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["Carlyle"],"seller":"Haniel","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Carlyle and CVC DIF agree to acquire BauWatch from Haniel","summary":"CVC DIF and Carlyle agreed to acquire remote video surveillance company BauWatch from Haniel, which keeps 10%.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2026/carlyle-and-cvc-dif-agree-to-acquire-bauwatch-from-haniel/","evidence":"Leading global mid-market infrastructure equity fund manager CVC DIF and global investment firm Carlyle (NASDAQ: CG) today announced that they have agreed to acquire BauWatch, the European market leader in technology-enabled remote video surveillance solutions, from Haniel, a leading German family equity company.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:e29accc4eeda2fc12d858cb50c6f0f27","date":"2026-09-23","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"CDN77","portco_name":"CDN77","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC Strategic Opportunities","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CDN77 agrees partnership with CVC for the next stage of its infrastructure growth","summary":"CVC Strategic Opportunities agreed to acquire a minority stake in internet infrastructure company CDN77, with its founder keeping a majority.","source_name":"CVC C