healthcare provider in Greece and Cyprus, in a transaction that values HHG at EUR 2.2 billion.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:82b1dd035368aeb3d5928d05bd7644da","date":"2025-02-03","date_text":null,"kind":"company_exit","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"OANDA","portco_name":"OANDA","target_website":null,"investor":"FTMO","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"seller","co_investors":[],"seller":"CVC Asia Fund IV","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC Funds agree sale of OANDA to FTMO","summary":"CVC Asia Fund IV agreed to sell online trading platform OANDA to FTMO; terms undisclosed.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2025/cvc-funds-agree-sale-of-oanda-to-ftmo/","evidence":"CVC Asia Fund IV, via its holding limited partnership, has entered into an agreement for the sale of OANDA Global Corporation (“OANDA”) to FTMO group (“FTMO”).","verified":null},{"key":"pr:7c4696ae0ced203cc9020dabaec77da6","date":"2025-02-06","date_text":null,"kind":"debt_financing","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"I-TRACING","portco_name":null,"target_website":null,"investor":"CVC Credit","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC Credit supports Eurazeo’s and Oakley’s acquisition of I-TRACING","summary":"CVC Credit was sole lender on debt facilities for Eurazeo and Oakley's acquisition of cybersecurity provider I-TRACING.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2025/cvc-credit-supports-eurazeo-s-and-oakley-s-acquisition-of-i-tracing/","evidence":"CVC Credit is pleased to announce that it has provided the debt facilities to support Eurazeo and Oakley’s acquisition of I-TRACING, a leading pure play managed security