lecom Group (“Manx”), the incumbent telecommunications provider on the Isle of Man, from funds managed by Basalt Infrastructure Partners LLP (“Basalt”).","verified":null},{"key":"pr:0707cc4df55ffe658222888ae3528659","date":"2025-10-28","date_text":null,"kind":"company_exit","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Universidad Alfonso X el Sabio Group","portco_name":"Universidad Alfonso X el Sabio (UAX)","target_website":"uax.com","investor":"Cinven","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"seller","co_investors":["Mubadala Investment Company","Jesús Núñez"],"seller":"CVC Funds","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Cinven to acquire Universidad Alfonso X el Sabio Group from CVC Funds","summary":"Cinven agreed with founder Jesús Núñez and Mubadala to acquire a majority stake in Spanish university group UAX from CVC Funds; terms undisclosed.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2025/cinven-to-acquire-universidad-alfonso-x-el-sabio-group-from-cvc-funds/","evidence":"International private equity firm, Cinven, today announces that it has agreed to partner with founder, Jesús Núñez, and Mubadala Investment Company, to acquire a majority stake in Universidad Alfonso X el Sabio Group (‘UAX’ or ‘the Group’), a leading private higher education platform in Spain, from CVC Funds.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:faa6b8435a571abda32696fe31474255","date":"2025-10-28","date_text":null,"kind":"debt_financing","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Rentokil Workwear France","portco_name":null,"target_website":null,"investor":"CVC Credit","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC Credit supports the acquisition of Rentokil Workwear France by H.I.G. Capital","summary":"CVC Credit provided bespoke financing for H.I.G. Capital's carve-out of Rentokil Workwear France from Rentokil Initial.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2025/cvc-credit-supports-the-acquisition-of-rentokil-workwear-france-by-hig-capital/","evidence":"CVC Credit is pleased to announce that it has provided a bespoke financing solution to H.I.G. Capital (“H.I.G.”) to support its carveout of the Rentokil Workwear France business (“the Company”), a leading textile rental and cleaning provider, from Rentokil Initial plc.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:e4e8503557843c4234caf89ad94d3f2d","date":"2025-10-28","date_text":null,"kind":"company_exit","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Tipico Group","portco_name":"Tipico","target_website":null,"investor":"Banijay Group","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"seller","co_investors":[],"seller":"CVC Capital Partners VII","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC announces sale of majority of CVC Capital Partners VII’s stake in Tipico to Banijay Group","summary":"CVC signed a binding agreement to sell a majority of Fund VII's stake in Tipico to Banijay, combining it with Betclic; CVC stays a minority shareholder.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2025/cvc-announces-sale-of-majority-of-cvc-capital-partners-vii-s-stake-in-tipico-to-banijay-group/","evidence":"CVC, one of the world’s leading private markets investment firms, today announced the signing of a binding agreement to sell a majority of CVC Capital Partners VII’s stake in Tipico Group (“Tipico”), the leading sports betting and online gaming operator in Germany and Austria, to Banijay Group (“Banijay”).","verified":null},{"key":"pr:ce383cf337171fe776c680cf35ceab95","date":"2025-11-03","date_text":null,"kind":"secondary","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Wireless Logic","portco_name":"Wireless Logic","target_website":null,"investor":"TPG GP Solutions","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"co_investor","co_investors":["CVC Secondary Partners","Partners Group"],"seller":"Montagu","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":2000000000.0,"currency":"EUR","amount_basis":"unspecified","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Montagu raises €2 billion continuation vehicle to support Wireless Logic’s next phase of global growth","summary":"Montagu closed a €2bn single-asset continuation vehicle for IoT platform Wireless Logic, led by TPG GP Solutions with CVC Secondary Partners and Partners Group as co-leads.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2025/montagu-raises-2-billion-continuation-vehicle-to-support-wireless-logic-s-next-phase-of-global-growth/","evidence":"Montagu, a leading mid-market private equity firm, today announced the successful close of a €2 billion single-asset continuation vehicle (“SACV”) to extend its partnership with Wireless Logic (“the Company”), a leading global Internet of Things (“IoT”) platform provider.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:612b56afd6411c9b29fe3c7f57145512","date":"2025-11-20","date_text":null,"kind":"secondary","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Curium","portco_name":null,"target_website":null,"investor":"ICG","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"co_investor","co_investors":["TPG GP Solutions","CVC Secondary Partners","Goldman Sachs Alternatives","Lunate","Pantheon","Ardian"],"seller":"CapVest","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":7000000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"enterprise_value","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CapVest recapitalizes Curium to accelerate its growth strategy, marking the largest transaction in nuclear medicine globally","summary":"CapVest recapitalised Curium through a continuation vehicle valuing it at about $7bn, led by ICG, TPG GP Solutions and CVC Secondary Partners."