e the next stage of growth","summary":"CVC DIF committed primary equity for a majority controlling stake in renewable developer Low Carbon, part of c.£1.1bn of committed capital with MassMutual follow-on equity and refinanced debt.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2025/low-carbon-secures-landmark-investment-from-cvc-dif-to-drive-the-next-stage-of-growth/","evidence":"CVC DIF’s investment, when combined with follow-on investment from existing shareholder MassMutual, the refinancing of existing project finance debt and raising of a Holdco facility, will secure c. £1.1 billion of committed capital for Low Carbon.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:2701d152f4b14fd44e39912cdd32f638","date":"2025-12-02","date_text":null,"kind":"company_exit","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Domestic & General","portco_name":"Domestic & General","target_website":"domesticandgeneral.com","investor":"Asurion","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"seller","co_investors":[],"seller":"CVC Funds and Luxinva (ADIA)","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Asurion to acquire Domestic & General, establishing a global leader in technology and appliance care committed to excellence in customer service","summary":"Asurion reached a definitive agreement to acquire appliance care provider Domestic & General from CVC Funds and ADIA's Luxinva.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2025/asurion-to-acquire-domestic-general-establishing-a-global-leader-in-technology-and-appliance-care-committed-to-excellence-in-customer-service/","evidence":"Domestic & General is being acquired from certain funds (“CVC Funds”) advised by CVC Capital Partners (“CVC”) and Luxinva S.A., an entity wholly-owned by the Abu Dhabi Investment Authority (“ADIA”).","verified":null},{"key":"pr:9731191ebdc3622ca5768617bc415319","date":"2025-12