-European provider of clinical laboratory and medical diagnostic services, by Ephios Luxembourg S.à r.l., an entity controlled by funds managed and/or advised by Cinven.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:169a87f42a391ce07dc9009878bad227","date":"2024-03-15","date_text":null,"kind":"debt_financing","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Innovative Beauty Group","portco_name":null,"target_website":null,"investor":"CVC Credit","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC Credit provides debt facilities for the acquisition of Innovative Beauty Group by Fremman Capital","summary":"CVC Credit agreed to provide, as sole lender, the debt facilities for Fremman Capital's acquisition of Innovative Beauty Group from Albéa.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2024/2024-03-15-cvc-credit-provides-debt-facilities-for-the-acquisition-of-innovative-beauty-group-by-fremman-capital/","evidence":"CVC Credit, the €40 billion global credit management business of CVC, is pleased to announce that it has agreed to provide the debt facilities to support Fremman Capital’s acquisition of Innovative Beauty Group (“IBG”), a beauty and personal care service provider, currently part of the Albéa group.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:878efaf5263e8e0a097fe7ba3cfc90db","date":"2024-03-26","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Monbake","portco_name":"Monbake","target_website":"monbake.com","investor":"CVC funds","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"Ardian, Alantra, Artá and Landon","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC funds invest in Monbake Group to support its growth strategy","summary":"Ardian, Alantra, Artá and Landon agreed to sell their stakes in Spanish frozen dough producer Monbake to CVC funds.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2024/2024-03-26-cvc-funds-invest-in-monbake-group-to-support-its-growth-strategy/","evidence":"Ardian, Alantra, Artá, and Landon have agreed to sell their stake in Monbake to CVC funds after successfully completing the objective they set themselves, in which the Monbake Group has consolidated its position as one of the three main producers and distributors of frozen dough at national level.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:1b2d87be47db2467fa063cc70e47d9e5","date":"2024-04-16","date_text":null,"kind":"secondary","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Multiversity","portco_name":"Multiversity","target_website":"multiversity.it","investor":"CVC continuation fund","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["CVC Capital Partners VIII"],"seller":"CVC Capital Partners VII","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC extends its partnership with Multiversity","summary":"CVC transferred Italian online university group Multiversity from Fund VII to a CVC-managed continuation fund, with Fund VIII also expected to invest.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2024/cvc-extends-its-partnership-with-multiversity/","evidence":"CVC is pleased to announce it has extended its partnership with Multiversity, a leading Italian online higher education provider, through a transfer of the business from CVC Capital Partners VII (“Fund VII”) to a CVC managed continuation fund.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:262f6c248a56949d8c0b9861bf930a93","date":"2024-04-18","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"World of Talents","portco_name":"World of Talents","target_website":"houseoftalents.be","investor":"CVC Funds","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"Baltisse","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC agrees investment in World of Talents to accelerate growth strategy and becomes majority shareholder","summary":"CVC agreed to invest in HR platform World of Talents and become majority shareholder, with Baltisse selling its majority stake but reinvesting.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2024/2024-04-18-cvc-agrees-investment-in-world-of-talents-to-accelerate-growth-strategy-and-becomes-majority-shareholder/","evidence":"Baltisse is selling its majority stake but is reinvesting a significant portion.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:f1025eaf0c42e90762bf9ce8633cfc2f","date":"2024-05-08","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Hempel","portco_name":"Hempel","target_website":"hempel.com","investor":"CVC Funds","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":30.0,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Hempel enters strategic partnership with CVC to accelerate long-term growth","summary":"The Hempel Foundation agreed to admit CVC Funds as a minority investor in Hempel A/S, subscribing to new shares for a stake of up to 30% over time.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2024/2024-05-08-hempel-enters-strategic-partnership-with-cvc-to-accelerate-long-term-growth/","evidence":"CVC Funds as the minority investor will subscribe to new shares, equating to a stake in Hempel A/S of up to 30% over time.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:d6ea09483a3cec4c66c2a262af102b51","date":"2024-06-10","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"URUS Group","portco_name":"URUS Group","target_website":"urus.org","investor":"CVC Capital Partners IX","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"URUS Group welcomes CVC Capital Partners as a new strategic partner","summary":"CVC Fund IX agreed to take a stake in cattle genetics group URUS alongside Pon Holdings and Cooperative Resources International.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2024/2024-06-10-urus-group-welcomes-cvc-capital-partners-as-a-new-strategic-partner/","evidence":"CVC will take a stake in the company and will act as a supportive shareholder in close cooperation with existing shareholders Pon Holdings and Cooperative Resources International (CRI).","verified":null},{"key":"pr:e3852c28da228de8bf6ded13e2954552","date":"2024-06-18","date_text":null,"kind":"company_exit","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"GEMS Education","portco_name":"GEMS Education","target_website":null,"investor":"Brookfield Asset Management","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"seller","co_investors":[],"seller":"CVC Strategic Opportunities Fund I and Fund II consortium","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC Strategic Opportunities agrees partial sale of its investment in GEMS Education","summary":"A CVC Strategic Opportunities-led consortium agreed to sell a majority of its stake in GEMS Education to a Brookfield-led consortium, retaining a stake.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2024/2024-06-18-cvc-strategic-opportunities-agrees-partial-sale-of-its-investment-in-gems-education/","evidence":"A consortium led by CVC Strategic Opportunities Fund I and Fund II, with co-investors (“CVC Consortium”) has today 