d-welcomes-cvc-funds-as-its-new-majority-shareholder/","evidence":"Partner in Pet Food (“PPF”), a market-leading European pet food manufacturer, is pleased to welcome CVC Capital Partners IX as its new majority shareholder, alongside its existing investor Cinven.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:1d5f4d0c44965bdb591ecff2ba8b14ba","date":"2024-07-25","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"HiSERV","portco_name":"HiSERV","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC DIF","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"AVECO Holding","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC DIF to acquire leading German aviation ground service equipment lessor HiSERV","summary":"CVC DIF agreed via CIF III to acquire German airport ground service equipment lessor HiSERV from AVECO Holding.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2024/2024-07-25-cvc-dif-to-acquire-leading-german-aviation-ground-service-equipment-lessor-hiserv/","evidence":"CVC DIF, the infrastructure strategy of leading global private markets manager CVC (via its CIF III fund), has agreed the acquisition of HiSERV, the German market leader in aviation ground service equipment (GSE) leasing from AVECO Holding.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:b2d817ba4f1acbeefeee95ab91737a20","date":"2024-08-05","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Therakos","portco_name":"Therakos","target_website":"therakos.com","investor":"CVC Capital Partners Fund IX","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"Mallinckrodt","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":925000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"unspecified","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Mallinckrodt reaches agreement to sell Therakos business to CVC","summary":"CVC Fund IX agreed to acquire Mallinckrodt's Therakos photopheresis business for $925m, subject to adjustments.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2024/2024-08-05-mallinckrodt-reaches-agreement-to-sell-therakos-business-to-cvc/","evidence":"DUBLIN and LUXEMBOURG – August 5, 2024 – Mallinckrodt plc (“Mallinckrodt” or the “Company”), a global specialty pharmaceutical company, and CVC Capital Partners (“CVC”), one of the world’s leading investment firms, today announced that they have entered into a definitive agreement1 under which CVC Capital Partners Fund IX will acquire the Company’s Therakos business for a purchase price of $925 million, subject to customary adjustments.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:16b4c89ccf36edf8a04b4b37513c3d8f","date":"2024-08-07","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"medneo UK","portco_name":"medneo UK","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC DIF","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"medneo Group","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC DIF agrees to acquire diagnostic imaging business medneo UK","summary":"CVC DIF acquired mobile MRI and CT imaging provider medneo UK from medneo Group via CIF III.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2024/2024-08-07-cvc-dif-agrees-to-acquire-diagnostic-imaging-business-medneo-uk/","evidence":"CVC DIF, the infrastructure strategy of leading global private markets manager CVC (via its CIF III fund), is pleased to announce the acquisition from medneo Group of medneo UK, a leading diagnostic imaging company, specialising in the provision of mobile MRI and CT scanners, and imaging services.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:9d08212a5c11010cafd3474fa891915d","date":"2024-08-10","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","t