side CD&R; terms undisclosed.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2024/2024-08-13-cvc-joins-cdr-as-an-investment-partner-in-epicor/","evidence":"New York, NY and Austin, TX – August 13, 2024 – Clayton, Dubilier & Rice (“CD&R”) and CVC, today announced that funds managed by CVC have agreed to acquire a significant ownership position in Epicor, a global provider of industry-specific enterprise software to promote business growth.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:be6183926c96fc7866fe612411819ba1","date":"2024-08-28","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Odevo","portco_name":"Odevo","target_website":"odevo.com","investor":"CVC Capital Partners Fund IX","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["Fidelio"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Odevo, strengthens investor base by welcoming CVC funds as a new strategic partner alongside Fidelio","summary":"CVC Fund IX agreed to join the Fidelio-led investor group in residential property manager Odevo.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2024/2024-08-28-odevo-strengthens-investor-base-by-welcoming-cvc-funds-as-a-new-strategic-partner-alongside-fidelio/","evidence":"Odevo, a tech-enabled residential property management company with leading positions in Europe and USA, today announces that CVC funds (“CVC”) have agreed to join the group of investors led by Swedish firm Fidelio and its existing management team.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:8ec5687ef8906901bad2ab862f9215b1","date":"2024-09-05","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"PharmaResearch","portco_name":"PharmaResearch","target_website":"pharmaresearch.co.kr","investor":"CVC","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"selle