rading-on-the-warsaw-stock-exchange/","evidence":"Based on the set offer price (PLN 21.50, the top of the price range), the value of the Offering was PLN 6.45 bn.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:f75fe5ded6ecb284353f28d719e05759","date":"2024-10-28","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Superstruct Entertainment","portco_name":"Superstruct Entertainment","target_website":"superstruct.com","investor":"CVC","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["KKR"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC joins KKR in the acquisition of Superstruct Entertainment","summary":"CVC invested alongside KKR in festival operator Superstruct Entertainment after KKR's acquisition closed.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2024/2024-10-28-cvc-joins-kkr-in-the-acquisition-of-superstruct-entertainment/","evidence":"London, October 28, 2024 – KKR and CVC, two leading global investment firms, today announce that CVC has invested alongside KKR to support Superstruct Entertainment (“Superstruct”) in its next phase of development as one of the world’s premier live entertainment groups.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:150cbe5456dac779554920c0e66aca57","date":"2024-10-29","date_text":null,"kind":"debt_financing","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"ILERNA","portco_name":null,"target_website":null,"investor":"CVC Credit","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["CAPZA"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC Credit and CAPZA support the acquisition of ILERNA","summary":"CVC Credit and CAPZA co-arranged a unitranche financing for Jacobs Holding's acquisition of Spanish online vocational trainer ILERNA.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2024/2024-10-29-cvc-credit-and-capza-support-the-acquisition-of-ilerna/","evidence":"CVC Credit, the global credit management business of CVC, and CAPZA, a leading player in private investments in European SMEs, are pleased to announce the co-arrangement of a Unitranche financing to support the acquisition of ILERNA by Jacobs Holding.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:028694143c0f4654fedeb3268530cd41","date":"2024-10-31","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Adam Ecotech","portco_name":"Adam Ecotech","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC DIF","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"Ogic Informatica","round":null,"stake_pct":100.0,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC DIF to acquire leading data centre operator Adam Ecotech","summary":"CVC DIF agreed to acquire 100% of Spanish colocation data centre operator Adam Ecotech from Ogic Informatica.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2024/2024-10-31-cvc-dif-to-acquire-leading-data-centre-operator-adam-ecotech/","evidence":"CVC DIF has agreed to acquire a 100% stake in Adam Ecotech, the data centre operator, with operations in Madrid and Barcelona, from Ogic Informatica.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:9308d35b85b099aa369f6c9983b6c9ab","date":"2024-11-04","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"ECO (Singapore)","portco_name":"ECO (Singapore)","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC DIF","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"Séché Environnement","round":null,"stake_pct":49.9,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC DIF acquires strategic interest in Singapore’s leading hazardous waste management company ECO","summary":"CVC DIF agreed to acquire a 49.9% stake in Singapore hazardous waste manager ECO from Séché Environnement, which keeps 50.1%.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2024/2024-11-04-cvc-dif-acquires-strategic-interest-in-singapore-s-leading-hazardous-waste-management-company-eco/","evidence":"CVC DIF, the infrastructure arm of global private markets manager CVC, has agreed to acquire a 49.9% stake in ECO, Singapore’s leading hazardous waste management company (by market share, range of service offerings & treatment and incineration capacity), from Séché Environnement (who will retain a 50.1% share).","verified":null},{"key":"pr:16f06004eb7fc43227c8be5daf28395b","date":"2024-11-18","date_text":null,"kind":"secondary","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Cin7","portco_name":null,"target_website":null,"investor":"CVC Secondary Partners","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["Ares Management","BlackRock","Goldman Sachs Asset Management","Schroders Capital"],"seller":"Rubicon Technology Partners","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":500000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"unspecified","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Rubicon Technology Partners Closes $500 Million Single-Asset Continuation Fund to Support the Continued Growth of Cin7","summary":"Rubicon Technology Partners closed a $500m single-asset continuation fund for Cin7 with CVC Secondary Partners as lead investor.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2024/2024-11-18-rubicon-technology-partners-closes-500-million-single-asset-continuation-fund-to-support-the-continued-growth-of-cin7/","evidence":"Boulder, CO - Rubicon Technology Partners (“Rubicon”), a private equity firm focused exclusively on middle-market software investments, today announced the successful completion of a $500 million single-asset continuation fund to extend its partnership with Cin7, a global leader in cloud-based inventory management software.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:3ec9b49c524754183ec5bddf1449572d","date":"2024-11-21","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"JW Water Holdings","portco_name":"JW Water Holdings","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC DIF","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC DIF acquires a portfolio of US regulated water and wastewater utilities","summary":"CVC DIF acquired Arizona regulated water utility platform JW Water through DIF Infrastructure VII.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2024/2024-11-21-cvc-dif-acquires-a-portfolio-of-us-regulated-water-and-wastewater-utilities/","evidence":"CVC DIF has acquired JW Water Holdings (JW Water), a regulated water and wastewater utility platform serving approximately 9,000 customers across ten utilities in Arizona.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:fc19bdccaa6100736c17c6a83d3b148e","date":"2024-11-21","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Robson utilities","portco_name":"Robson utilities","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC DIF","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"Robson Communities","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC DIF acquires a portfolio of US regulated water and wastewater utilities","summary":"CVC DIF acquired eight Arizona regulated water and wastewater utilities developed by Ed Robson, combining them with JW Water.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2024/2024-11-21-cvc-dif-acquires-a-portfolio-of-us-regulated-water-and-wastewater-utilities/","evidence":"Concurrent with the acquisition of JW Water, CVC DIF also acquired a portfolio of eight regulated water and wastewater utilities, which were originally developed or purchased by real estate developer Ed Robson (Robson).","verified":null},{"key":"pr:363c1c2fea4e72357f3aadf55923f460","date":"2024-12-05","date_text":null,"kind":"company_exit","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Cerro Grande and Peralta wind farms","portco_name":null,"target_website":null,"investor":"Pluspetrol","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":null,"co_investors":[],"seller":"DIF Infrastructure V and DIF Infrastructure VI","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC DIF sells 169MW portfolio of Uruguayan wind farm projects to Pluspetrol","summary":"CVC DIF funds V and VI completed the sale of the 169MW Cerro Grande and Peralta wind farms in Uruguay to Pluspetrol.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2024/cvc-dif-sells-169mw-portfolio-of-uruguayan-wind-farm-projects-to-pluspetrol/","evidence":"CVC DIF, the infrastructure strategy of leading global private markets manager CVC, is pleased to announce that DIF Infrastructure V (DIF V) and DIF Infrastructure VI (DIF VI) have completed the sale of the Cerro Grande and Peralta wind farm projects in Uruguay to Pluspetrol.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:917ead17a5216e2ad68138f66465ab50","date":"2023-01-03","date_text":null,"kind":"company_exit","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"PKP Energetyka","portco_name":"PKP Energetyka","target_website":null,"investor":"PGE","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"seller","co_investors":[],"seller":"CVC Capital Partners Fund VI","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":5944500000.0,"currency":"PLN","amount_basis":"enterprise_value","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC has signed a preliminary agreement for the sale of PKP Energetyka","summary":"CVC Fund VI signed a preliminary agreement to sell Polish rail energy distributor PKP Energetyka to PGE for an EV of PLN 5,944.5m.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2023/2023-01-03-cvc-has-signed-a-preliminary-agreement-for-the-sale-of-pkp-energetyka/","evidence":"CVC Capital Partners Fund VI (“CVC”) has signed a preliminary agreement for the sale of PKP Energetyka, an energy distributor for the Polish railway sector and provider of traction network maintenance services, to PGE, the state-controlled- public power company and the largest power producing company in Poland for an EV of PLN 5,944.5 million.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:e74d7604c8ddc43726f5767f17dc23fc","date":"2023-02-06","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Scan Global Logistics","portco_name":"Scan Global Logistics","target_website":"scangl.com","investor":"CVC Capital Partners Fund VIII","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"AEA Investors Small Business Private Equity-led investor group","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Scan Global Logistics partners with CVC to further accelerate international growth","summary":"CVC Fund VIII agreed to acquire a majority shareholding in Danish logistics provider Scan Global Logistics from an AEA-led investor group.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2023/2023-02-06-scan-global-logistics-partners-with-cvc-to-further-accelerate-international-growth/","evidence":"Copenhagen, Denmark, 6 February, 2023; Scan Global Logistics (SGL), headquartered in Denmark, announces that CVC Capital Partners Fund VIII (CVC) has agreed to acquire a majority shareholding in the company from an investor group led by AEA Investors Small Business Private Equity (AEA).","verified":null},{"key":"pr:c095c2d66d392c92