es of Sogo Medical Group Co., Ltd. (“Sogo”) in mid-Feb 2024 from Polaris Private Equity Fund V (\"Polaris Fund V\"), managed by Polaris Capital Group Co., Ltd. (\"Polaris\"), and other shareholders.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:9a398acf315a07f66c3ec641bbf0d49c","date":"2023-12-22","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Packeta","portco_name":"Packeta","target_website":"packeta.com","investor":"CVC Capital Partners VIII","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["EMMA Capital","R2G"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC Funds and Emma Capital acquire Packeta, a leading e-commerce logistics and delivery player in Czechia and Slovakia","summary":"CVC Fund VIII agreed to acquire Czech e-commerce delivery group Packeta in partnership with EMMA Capital, with R2G expected to provide capital.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2023/2023-12-22-cvc-funds-and-emma-capital-acquire-packeta/","evidence":"CVC has agreed to acquire Packeta Group (“Packeta”), a leading e-commerce logistics and out-of-home delivery player in the Czech Republic and Slovakia through its CVC Capital Partners VIII.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:8eb6538e592b2a6af7856cd8fcf5b545","date":"2022-01-25","date_text":null,"kind":"debt_financing","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Pharmathen","portco_name":null,"target_website":null,"investor":"CVC Credit","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC Credit supports the acquisition of Pharmathen by Partners Group","summary":"CVC Credit co-arranged unitranche facilities with an ESG margin ratchet for Partners Group's acquisition of Pharmathen.","sou