ributor of heavy building materials in Northern Europe.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:e30f7ab992e4961d9d3858a3927860e6","date":"2021-02-01","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Volleyball World","portco_name":"Volleyball World","target_website":"en.volleyballworld.com","investor":"CVC Capital Partners Fund VII","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["FIVB"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"FIVB partners with CVC Capital Partners to drive global growth of volleyball","summary":"The FIVB and CVC Fund VII launched Volleyball World, the sport's new commercial entity, with FIVB as majority shareholder.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2021/2021-02-01-fivb-partners-with-cvc-capital-partners-to-drive-global-growth-of-volleyball/","evidence":"As the majority shareholder in Volleyball World, FIVB will oversee the new commercial vision for volleyball while ensuring the interests of all stakeholders are represented.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:b599385f67e792011d643d37120fb6fc","date":"2021-02-03","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"FineToday (Shiseido Personal Care business)","portco_name":"FineToday","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC Capital Partners Asia Fund V","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"Shiseido","round":null,"stake_pct":65.0,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC Capital Partners agrees to joint venture with Shiseido in Personal Care business","summary":"CVC Asia V agreed to acquire 65% of Shiseido's Personal Care business as a joint venture, with Shiseido keeping 35%.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2021