er and top 3 retail-focused insurance broker with rapid growth.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:f4314207633963742e78684d9ec40948","date":"2021-05-14","date_text":null,"kind":"company_exit","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"AR Packaging","portco_name":"AR Packaging","target_website":null,"investor":"Graphic Packaging Holding Company","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"seller","co_investors":[],"seller":"CVC Capital Partners Fund VI","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":1450000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"unspecified","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Graphic Packaging Holding Company to acquire AR Packaging from CVC Funds","summary":"Graphic Packaging agreed to acquire AR Packaging from CVC Fund VI for about $1.45bn in cash.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2021/2021-05-14-graphic-packaging-holding-company-to-acquire-ar-packaging-from-cvc-funds/","evidence":"Graphic Packaging Holding Company, (\"Graphic Packaging\" or the \"Company\"), a leading vertically-integrated provider of sustainable fiber-based consumer packaging solutions, and CVC Capital Partners Fund VI today announced a definitive agreement under which Graphic Packaging will acquire AR Packaging Group AB (\"AR Packaging\"), Europe's second largest producer of fiber-based consumer packaging, for approximately $1.45 billion in cash, subject to customary adjustments.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:ad6ed11a8463cc18728ec9b95ef0c2c8","date":"2021-05-19","date_text":null,"kind":"funding_round","asset_class":"venture_capital","target":"Great Deals","portco_name":"Great Deals","target_website":null,"investor":"Fast Group","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"co_investor","co_investors":["CVC Capital Partners","Navegar"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Great Deals receives investment from Fast Group, 