saction, CVC will acquire a 60% stake from the company's founder, Joop van den Ende, who will remain a 40% shareholder in the business and as co-chairman.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:d5ca1aef53fb20272a981c298ca188d1","date":"2015-06-22","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Alvogen","portco_name":"Alvogen","target_website":"alvogen.com","investor":"CVC Capital Partners","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["Temasek","Vatera Healthcare Partners"],"seller":"Pamplona Capital Management","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC leads investment consortium to acquire controlling stake in Alvogen","summary":"A CVC-led consortium with Temasek and Vatera acquired a controlling stake in pharma company Alvogen from Pamplona.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2015/2015-06-22-cvc-leads-investment-consortium-to-acquire-controlling-stake-in-alvogen/","evidence":"A consortium of investors led by CVC Capital Partners (\"CVC\") and including Singapore-based investment company Temasek (\"Temasek\") and Vatera Healthcare Partners (\"Vatera\") have acquired a controlling stake in Alvogen, the high growth pharmaceutical company.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:9006a74d2d863b0d883fb0b75c302e53","date":"2015-07-01","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Linxens","portco_name":"Linxens","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC Fund VI","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"Astorg Partners","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC Fund VI enters exclusive negotiations acquire Linxens","summary":"CVC and Astorg entered exclusive discussions on the acquisition of smart card connector maker Linxens by CVC.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2015/2015-07-01-cvc-fund-vi-enters-exclusive-negotiations-acquire-linxens/","evidence":"CVC Capital Partners (\"CVC\") and Astorg Partners (\"Astorg\") today announced that they have entered into exclusive discussions regarding the acquisition of Linxens (or “the Company”) by CVC.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:b27be2448828e2437b7cb59c1bdc1fcf","date":"2015-07-23","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"PKP Energetyka","portco_name":"PKP Energetyka","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC Fund VI","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"Polish State Railways (PKP)","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":1965000000.0,"currency":"PLN","amount_basis":"enterprise_value","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC Capital Partners acquires PKP Energetyka from Polish State Railways","summary":"CVC-advised funds agreed to acquire PKP Energetyka from Polish State Railways at an EV of PLN 1,965m (approx. €477m).","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2015/2015-07-23-cvc-fund-vi-acquires-pkp-energetyka-from-polish-state-railways/","evidence":"CVC Capital Partners (\"CVC\") announced today that funds advised by CVC have signed an agreement to acquire PKPE Energetyka (\"PKPE), the energy unit of the Polish National Railways (\"PKP\") in a transaction that puts an enterprise value on the business of PLN 1,965m (approx. €477m).","verified":true},{"key":"pr:2aa1adc06588e1b9c0645fafc7da26df","date":"2015-11-23","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Petco","portco_name":"Petco","target_website":"petco.com","investor":"CVC Fund VI","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["CPP Investment Board"],"seller":"TPG and Leonard Green & Partners","round":null,"stake_pct":null,