 become a co-shareholder in the RAC through the purchase of Carlyle's stake in the RAC.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:2a0a0526c1ecb4d2bbdaed372c4bcc95","date":"2015-12-04","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Moto","portco_name":"Moto","target_website":"moto-way.com","investor":"CVC Strategic Opportunities","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"Universities Superannuation Scheme","round":null,"stake_pct":40.0,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC Strategic Opportunities Fund partners with USS to invest in Moto","summary":"USS sold a 40% shareholding in UK motorway services operator Moto to CVC Strategic Opportunities funds.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2015/2015-12-04-cvc-strategic-opportunities-fund-partners-with-uss-to-invest-in-moto/","evidence":"CVC Capital Partners (\"CVC\") and Universities Superannuation Scheme (\"USS\") announced today that USS has sold a 40% shareholding in Moto to funds advised by CVC.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:4121854eed7738786cfbeb001009d980","date":"2015-12-16","date_text":null,"kind":"funding_round","asset_class":"venture_capital","target":"Kount","portco_name":"Kount","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC Growth Fund","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":null,"round":"growth","stake_pct":null,"amount":80000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"round_size","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC Capital Partners' Growth Fund Makes $80 Million Investment in Kount Inc.","summary":"CVC Growth Fund agreed to provide an $80m growth equity investment to fraud prevention company Kount.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2015/2015-12-16-cvc-growth-fund-makes-80-million-investment-in-kount-inc/","evidence":"Kount Inc. (