 Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2011/2011-07-20-convergex-group-agrees-to-be-acquired-by-cvc-capital-partners/","evidence":"ConvergEx Group (\"ConvergEx\"), a leading technology company, today announced that its parent company ConvergEx Holdings, LLC has signed a definitive agreement to be acquired by funds advised by CVC Capital Partners (\"CVC\") in an all cash transaction expected to close in the early autumn.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:807ec5d3bd2330887e9429b816467cea","date":"2011-08-03","date_text":null,"kind":"company_exit","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Hung Hing Printing Group","portco_name":"Hung Hing Printing Group","target_website":null,"investor":"Rengo Co., Ltd.","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"seller","co_investors":[],"seller":"CVC Asia Pacific","round":null,"stake_pct":29.9,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC completes sale of 29.9% stake in Hung Hing Printing Group Limited","summary":"CVC Asia Pacific funds completed the sale of a 29.9% stake in Hung Hing Printing to Rengo, retaining 7.6%.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2011/2011-08-03-cvc-completes-sale-of-299-stake-in-hung-hing-printing-group-limited/","evidence":"On 3 August 2011, funds advised by CVC Asia Pacific Limited (\"CVC\") completed the sale of a 29.9% stake in Hung Hing Printing Group Limited (‘Hung Hing') to Rengo Co., Ltd. (\"Rengo\") of Japan.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:306c8ac752f8a457aca17104f0ba4f79","date":"2011-08-19","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Virgin Active","portco_name":"Virgin Active","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC Capital Partners","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"Virgin Group","round":null,"stake_pct":51.0,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuat