l,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Cloetta and LEAF to merge","summary":"Cloetta and CVC/Nordic Capital-owned LEAF agreed to merge, valuing LEAF at SEK 6.8bn cash and debt-free, with LEAF shareholders getting 57.6% of the enlarged Cloetta.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2011/2011-12-16-cloetta-and-leaf-to-merge/","evidence":"The Transaction, valuing LEAF at SEK 6.8 billion on a cash and debt-free basis, will be financed through a fully underwritten rights issue, an issue in kind to LEAF's shareholders and bank financing.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:a5e6a2ff60221bd0e1f98f7c560d7439","date":"2011-12-16","date_text":null,"kind":"company_exit","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Taminco","portco_name":"Taminco","target_website":null,"investor":"Apollo Global Management","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"seller","co_investors":[],"seller":"CVC Capital Partners","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC Capital Partners announces sale of Taminco","summary":"CVC-advised funds agreed to sell their majority stake in alkylamines producer Taminco to Apollo affiliates.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2011/2011-12-16-cvc-capital-partners-announces-sale-of-taminco/","evidence":"Funds advised by CVC Capital Partners (\"CVC\") today announced the sale of their majority stake in Taminco, the world's largest producer of alkylamines and derivatives to affiliates of Apollo Global Management (\"Apollo\").","verified":null},{"key":"pr:75d683518720aeede705fe137d478862","date":"2010-09-17","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Sunrise Communications","portco_name":"Sunrise Communications","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC Capital Partners","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"TDC","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC Capital Partners and TDC sign agreement on Sunrise","summary":"CVC-advised funds agreed to acquire Swiss telecom operator Sunrise from TDC at an enterprise value of CHF3.3bn (completed October 2010).","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2010/2010-09-17-cvc-capital-partners-and-tdc-sign-agreement-on-sunrise/","evidence":"The transaction, which values Sunrise at an enterprise value of CHF3.3bn, demonstrates CVC’s commitment to expand its activities in the telecommunications sector and enables Sunrise to pursue its challenger strategy on the Swiss market.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:51bf4394e7f111d9dc81849cd30a81d9","date":"2010-09-30","date_text":null,"kind":"ipo","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Elster Group","portco_name":"Elster Group","target_website":null,"investor":"Undisclosed","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"seller","co_investors":[],"seller":"Rembrandt Holdings S.A. (CVC funds)","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Elster prices Initial Public Offering","summary":"CVC-owned Elster Group priced its NYSE IPO of 16.2 million ADSs at $13 per ADS.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2010/2010-09-30-elster-prices-initial-public-offering/","evidence":"Elster Group SE (NYSE: ELT), one of the world's largest electricity, gas and water measurement and control providers with products and solutions widely used by utilities in the traditional and emerging Smart Grid markets, today announced the pricing of its initial public offering of American Depositary Shares (ADSs), four of which represent one ordinary share of Elster Group SE, at a price of $13.00 per ADS.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:c62d2090f492b78d25b22070ef864b48",