e leading specialty retailer of swimming pool supplies and related products in the United States.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:b3042247ac304c9a9e527742aa1f95f3","date":"2010-08-11","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Abertis","portco_name":"Abertis","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC Capital Partners","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["ACS"],"seller":"ACS","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":3000000000.0,"currency":"EUR","amount_basis":"stake_price","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC joins ACS in Abertis","summary":"CVC-advised funds agreed to invest with ACS in a structure controlling ACS's 25.8% stake in Abertis, valued at €3,000m.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2010/2010-08-11-cvc-joins-acs-in-abertis/","evidence":"The transaction values the stake at €3,000 million.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:d02b6b56156d39937ea1b860d617a613","date":"2010-08-07","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Autobar Group","portco_name":"Autobar Group","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC Capital Partners","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"Charterhouse Capital Partners","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC Capital Partners agrees to acquire Autobar Group","summary":"CVC-advised funds agreed to acquire a majority stake in European vending company Autobar from Charterhouse-advised funds.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2010/2010-08-07-cvc-capital-partners-agrees-to-acquire-autobar-group/","evidence":"Funds advised by CVC Capital Partners (\"CVC\") have agreed to acquire a majority stake in Autobar Group from funds advised by Charterhouse Capital Partners (\"Charterhouse\").","ve