in Merlin Entertainments in a deal valuing it at £2.25bn, with Blackstone reducing its holding.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2010/2010-06-24-cvc-funds-agree-acquisition-of-stake-in-merlin-entertainments/","evidence":"Under the transaction, which values Merlin at £2.25bn, Blackstone has reduced its stake, but will continue to hold a significant interest in the company.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:7019fd0ef09f9d94af4c3339b6d39173","date":"2010-05-20","date_text":null,"kind":"funding_round","asset_class":"venture_capital","target":"Avolon","portco_name":"Avolon","target_website":null,"investor":"Cinven","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"co_investor","co_investors":["CVC Capital Partners","Oak Hill Capital"],"seller":null,"round":"seed","stake_pct":null,"amount":750000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"round_size","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Aircraft leasing group attracts US$750 million from Cinven, CVC and Oak Hill Capital","summary":"Aircraft lessor Avolon completed an initial US$1.4bn capital raise including a US$750m equity commitment from Cinven, CVC and Oak Hill ($250m each).","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2010/2010-05-20-avolon-attracts-us-750-million-from-cinven-cvc-and-oak-hill-capital/","evidence":"Avolon, the aircraft leasing group, today announces it has successfully completed its initial capital raise of US$1.4 billion including an equity commitment of US$750 million from three of the world’s leading private equity firms.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:2742ba3e3525d5b6771afc2beaaa51ec","date":"2010-04-09","date_text":null,"kind":"company_exit","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"GS Paper and Packaging","portco_name":"GS Paper and Packaging","target_website":null,"investor":"Oji Paper","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"seller","co_investors":[],"seller":"CVC Asia Pacific","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC completes sale of GS Paper and Packaging in Malaysia","summary":"CVC Asia Pacific funds sold Malaysian paper and packaging group GSPP to Oji Paper.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2010/2010-04-09-cvc-completes-sale-of-gs-paper-and-packaging-in-malaysia/","evidence":"Funds advised by CVC Asia Pacific Limited (‘CVC’) have sold GS Paper and Packaging (‘GSPP’) to Oji Paper Co., Ltd. (‘Oji’) of Japan.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:90bd05154c7990e515f4a77e70531201","date":"2010-04-06","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Matahari Department Store","portco_name":"Matahari Department Store","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC Asia Pacific","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["PT Matahari Putra Prima Tbk"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":98.0,"amount":892000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"enterprise_value","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC completes acquisition of 98.0% stake in Matahari","summary":"CVC Asia Pacific funds with MPPA completed the acquisition of 98.0% of Matahari Department Store at an enterprise value of about US$892m.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2010/2010-04-06-cvc-completes-acquisition-of-980-stake-in-matahari/","evidence":"The transaction, which has an enterprise value of approximately US$892 million, is the largest ever foreign PE-led investment in Indonesia and also the largest completed in Asia this year.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:f44a7ccde6f6b8e36ca6d424f5410513","date":"2009-02-02","date_text":null,"kind":"company_exit","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Post Danmark","portco_name":"Post Danmark","target_website":null,"investor":"Danish State","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"seller","co_investors":[],"seller":"CVC Capital Partners","round":null,"stake_pct":22.0,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC announces two postal transactions","summary":"CVC agreed to sell its 22% stake in Post Danmark to the Danish State in connection with Post Danmark's merger with Posten.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2009/2009-02-02-cvc-announces-two-postal-transactions/","evidence":"CVC has entered into a conditional sale agreement with the Danish State for its 22% shareholder stake in Post Danmark A/S. The sale will be effected upon the closing of the merger between Post Danmark A/S and Posten AB of Sweden expected to take place during 2009.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:38c2df3094b13ee92b66fb59218d7c82","date":"2009-02-02","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"bpost (De Post - La Poste)","portco_name":"bpost (De Post - La Poste)","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC Capital Partners","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"Post Danmark","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":373000000.0,"currency":"EUR","amount_basis":"stake_price","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC announces two postal transactions","summary":"CVC agreed to acquire Post Danmark's entire interest in Belgium's De Post - La Poste for EUR 373m, taking CVC-controlled companies to 49.9%.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2009/2009-02-02-cvc-announces-two-postal-transactions/","evidence":"It has further been agreed with Post Danmark A/S that CVC would acquire Post Danmark’s entire ownership interest in De Post – La Poste for EUR 373 million.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:04c82afce7e0e3e317e7084e4c43bfdf","date":"2009-10-15","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"StarBev","portco_name":"StarBev","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC Capital Partners","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"Anheuser-Busch InBev","round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":2231000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"enterprise_value","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"Anheuser-Busch InBev agrees to sell Central European operations to CVC","summary":"AB InBev agreed to sell its Central European operations, later StarBev, to CVC for an EV of about USD 2,231m plus a contingent payment of up to USD 800m.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2009/2009-10-15-anheuser-busch-inbev-agrees-to-sell-central-european-operations-to-cvc/","evidence":"Anheuser-Busch InBev (Euronext: ABI) (NYSE: BUD) and CVC Capital Partners announced today that they have signed a definitive agreement under which Anheuser-Busch InBev (“ABI”) will sell its Central European operations to CVC Capital Partners (\"CVC\"), a leading global private equity firm, for an enterprise value of approximately USD 2,231 million and additional rights to a future payment estimated to be as much as USD 800 million contingent on CVC's return on its initial investment.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:9feab5a41e24293cc8db1378e7c1e14a","date":"2008-02-05","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Stella Group","portco_name":"Stella Group","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC Asia Pacific","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"MFS Limited","round":null,"stake_pct":65.0,"amount":400000000.0,"currency":"AUD","amount_basis":"stake_price","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC Asia Pacific acquires majority interest in Stella Group","summary":"CVC Asia Pacific funds agreed to acquire 65% of Australian travel and hospitality group Stella from MFS for A$400m plus costs.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2008/2008-02-05-cvc-asia-pacific-acquires-majority-interest-in-stella-group/","evidence":"Funds advised by private equity firm CVC Asia Pacific (CVC) have agreed to acquire from MFS Limited a 65 per cent interest in Stella Group for A$400 million plus reimbursement of certain costs.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:6570d131e2a6e0b6247a0907ffa56640","date":"2008-03-13","date_text":null,"kind":"add_on_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Asia Dekor","portco_name":"Asia Dekor","target_website":null,"investor":"Plantation Timber Products","sponsor_is_investor":false,"sponsor_role":"co_investor","co_investors":["CVC Asia Pacific"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":null,"currency":null,"amount_basis":null,"valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC completes acquisition of Asia Dekor","summary":"CVC Asia Pacific funds completed the 100% buyout of laminate flooring maker Asia Dekor as an add-on for portfolio company Plantation Timber Products.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2008/2008-03-13-cvc-completes-acquisition-of-asia-dekor/","evidence":"The transaction is a 100% buyout in China and represents an important add-on acquisition for Plantation Timber Products (PTP), an existing CVC portfolio company, strengthening PTP’s market position in both wood panels and laminate flooring.","verified":null},{"key":"pr:8221432936a43ededa960eb5b0410b08","date":"2008-06-03","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Evonik Industries","portco_name":"Evonik Industries","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC Capital Partners","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":[],"seller":"RAG Foundation","round":null,"stake_pct":25.01,"amount":2400000000.0,"currency":"EUR","amount_basis":"stake_price","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC acquires 25.01 percent stake in Evonik AG","summary":"CVC-advised funds agreed to acquire a 25.01% stake in Evonik Industries from the RAG Foundation for about €2.4bn.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2008/2008-06-03-cvc-acquires-2501-percent-stake-in-evonik-ag/","evidence":"Funds advised by CVC Capital Partners (\"CVC\") have agreed to acquire a 25.01 percent stake in Evonik Industries AG from the RAG Foundation for a purchase price of approximately 2.4 billion Euros announced Wilhelm Bonse-Geuking, CEO of the RAG Foundation.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:ad0a11613233e8f0d62dbc1da25cf236","date":"2008-06-17","date_text":null,"kind":"company_acquisition","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Magnum Corporation","portco_name":"Magnum Corporation","target_website":null,"investor":"CVC Asia Pacific","sponsor_is_investor":true,"sponsor_role":"investor","co_investors":["Multi-Purpose Holdings Berhad"],"seller":null,"round":null,"stake_pct":null,"amount":1540000000.0,"currency":"USD","amount_basis":"enterprise_value","valuation":null,"valuation_currency":null,"headline":"CVC completes joint buyout of Malaysia’s leading gaming company","summary":"CVC Asia Pacific funds, MPHB and management completed the public-to-private buyout of Malaysian gaming company Magnum, valued at US$1.54bn.","source_name":"CVC Capital Partners","source_url":"https://www.cvc.com/media/news/2008/2008-06-17-cvc-completes-joint-buyout-of-malaysia-s-leading-gaming-company/","evidence":"Funds advised by CVC Asia Pacific Limited (“CVC”), in partnership with Multi-Purpose Holdings Berhad (“MPHB”) and management, have successfully completed the buyout of Magnum Corporation Berhad (“Magnum”) in a public to private transaction valued at US$1.54 billion.","verified":true},{"key":"pr:23ec986d4b4a71a84184245829fbbf13","date":"2008-07-08","date_text":null,"kind":"minority_investment","asset_class":"private_equity","target":"Hung Hing Printing Group","portco_name":"Hung Hing Printing Group","target_website":